. 
. 
. * ===========================================================================
> ===
. * 1.2  CLEAN LOT-LEVEL VARIABLES
. * ===========================================================================
> ===
. 
. di as text _n "========================================"

========================================

. di as text    "  1.2: CLEANING LOT VARIABLES"
  1.2: CLEANING LOT VARIABLES

. di as text    "========================================"
========================================

. 
. * ---- Base value (importo_lotto) ----
. * This is the authority's estimated contract value BEFORE the tender, excludi
> ng
. * VAT. It determines which procurement procedure is legally required. It is o
> ur
. * RUNNING VARIABLE (after centring at €139k).
. destring importo_lotto, replace force
importo_lotto: all characters numeric; replaced as double

. label var importo_lotto "Lot base value (EUR, VAT excl.)"

. drop if missing(importo_lotto) | importo_lotto <= 0
(10 observations deleted)

. 
. * ---- Publication date ----
. * This is when the CIG was published on ANAC's system. We use it to assign lo
> ts
