. * ##                                                                         
>  ##
. * ##   PART 2: COVERAGE DIAGNOSTICS (Module R, continued)                    
>  ##
. * ##                                                                         
>  ##
. * ##   Checks whether the coverage discontinuity at 139k biases outcomes     
>  ##
