. * RESULTS 4.6 (h=40k unless stated; below×post coefficients):
. *                       days      lratio          single_bid
. *   main               −52.3     +0.075 (0.030)   +0.148
. *   donut 1k           −51.6     +0.083 (0.029)   +0.138
