                                      |    Newly eligible band (vs comparison band 139k-180k)  
                                      |                  0                  1             Total
--------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------
Post-reform (P2: Jun 2021 - Jun 2023) |                                                        
  0                                   |                                                        
    Mean                              |              0.140              0.171             0.162
    Frequency                         |           8039.000            2.1e+04           2.9e+04
  1                                   |                                                        
